8.jpg?t=1740826326"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477800/ss_e7e2615529d896f628cabfa5e9fc475d2ada1a40.1920x1080.jpg?t=1740826326","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477800/ss_e7e2615529d896f628cabfa5e9fc475d2ada1a40.600x338.jpg?t=1740826326"}],"short_description":"In Shelldom, snails worship alcohol\u2014a drink they love but one that kills them. Their cults sacrifice their own for more, trapped in a doomed cycle. But legend speaks of the Holy Water, hidden atop a merciless tower. Can you climb, endure, and break the curse? Or will you fall like the rest?","steam_appid":3477800,"support_info":{"email":"rotemandarinen4u@gmail.com","url":"https://roteman.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://roteman.com/"}